AmbireRecoveryActionConstructorTest
├── when the kit slot is read
│   └── it should equal the low twenty bytes of the hash of the string kit and the action
├── when the action is deployed at another address
│   └── it should derive the kit slot from that address
├── when the manager is read
│   └── it should equal the manager the constructor received
├── when the pinned implementation is read
│   └── it should equal the implementation the constructor received
├── when the key value is read
│   └── it should equal one as a word
└── when the kit slot is compared with the signer key slot of the action's own binding
    └── it should differ
